@PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5299

### 1. How many days can I work from another country?
POST {{PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How many days can I work from another country?"
}

### 2. Can I use public Wi-Fi while working remotely?
POST {{PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I use public Wi-Fi while working remotely?"
}

### 3. What should I do if my company laptop is stolen?
POST {{PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What should I do if my company laptop is stolen?"
}

### 4. Does the company pay for home internet?
POST {{PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Does the company pay for home internet?"
}

### 5. What company car can I buy? (expect: policy does not contain this information, no invented sources)
POST {{PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What company car can I buy?"
}

### Edge case: empty question should return 400
POST {{PolicyLens.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": ""
}
